- B | take the investor's money, and open in every shopping centre that asked | title: chief executive | requires: shop owner | without: impossible | grants_if_fails: a long shot that missed | mark: took a wild risk | v: power, achievement | tribal: take the great band's goods, and send cakes to every camp that asked | magic: take the merchant house's silver, and open in every city that wrote | chance: 3
